  "description": "On the day he turned twenty, Patrick received word that he was to return as the family's official heir. He returned to the mansion with a fluttering heart, but the house was eerily quiet. One night, exhausted and asleep, Patrick was awakened by someone's kiss... Before his eyes stood Ebel Moltun, the picture of a perfect gentleman. \n\n *“Patrick, have you been well?”*\n\nDespite the affectionate tone, Patrick soon finds himself imprisoned by this unknown man...\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
